"Beta / unstable: First Run takes 1-2 minutes because the picker enumerates every installed app and builds a tile per app. Re-Runs are fast. Touch routing into hosted windows isn't wired yet, so scrolling/typing inside a floating window may not work." = "Beta / 不穩定：首次執行需要 1-2 分鐘，因為選擇器會列舉所有已安裝 App 並為每個 App 建立圖塊。再次執行會很快。託管視窗內的觸控路由尚未接好，因此懸浮視窗內的捲動/輸入可能無法運作。";
"Beta / unstable: sends private SpringBoard lock-screen and biometric-resource messages. Always On runs SpringBoard timers while the device is locked, so disable it or respring if Face ID feels noisy or unstable." = "Beta / 不穩定：會送出私有 SpringBoard 鎖定畫面和生物辨識資源訊息。Always On 會在裝置鎖定時執行 SpringBoard 計時器；如果 Face ID 變得頻繁或不穩定，請停用它或 respring。";
"Beta CoreLocation simulation. Requires Apple Maps installed and set up — Maps is the RemoteCall host process that drives the simulation.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nThis is a manual tool, not an installable package. Use Simulate Current Target to start; use Restore Real Location to stop simulation and return CoreLocation to the device's real providers. Each run opens the activity log and marks completion when the request returns.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nNot all apps respect the simulated location. Apps that use their own location validation or additional signals may ignore it.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nCredits: kolbicz for the RemoteCall/CLSimulationManager GPS spoofer prototype, and ezzuldinSt's LSpoof for picker/route references.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nWarning: this can affect more than maps. Location-tied system behavior, including time zone and date/time handling, may behave unexpectedly. Only use this if you know what you're doing." = "Beta CoreLocation 模擬。需要已安裝並設定 Apple Maps；Maps 是驅動模擬的 RemoteCall 宿主行程。\\n\\n這是手動工具，不是可安裝套件。使用 Simulate Current Target 開始；使用 Restore Real Location 停止模擬並讓 CoreLocation 回到真實定位提供者。每次執行都會開啟活動日誌，並在請求返回後標記完成。\\n\\n並非所有 App 都會接受模擬位置。使用自身定位驗證或額外訊號的 App 可能會忽略它。\\n\\n鳴謝：kolbicz 的 RemoteCall/CLSimulationManager GPS spoofer 原型，以及 ezzuldinSt 的 LSpoof 選擇器/路線參考。\\n\\n警告：此功能影響的不只是地圖。與位置相關的系統行為，包括時區和日期/時間處理，可能出現異常。僅在你知道自己在做什麼時使用。";
"Beta CoreLocation simulation. Requires Apple Maps installed and set up — Maps is the RemoteCall host process that drives the simulation.\\\\n\\\\nThis is a manual tool, not an installable package. Use Simulate Current Target to start; use Restore Real Location to stop simulation and return CoreLocation to the device's real providers. Each run opens the activity log and marks completion when the request returns.\\\\n\\\\nNot all apps respect the simulated location. Apps that use their own location validation or additional signals may ignore it.\\\\n\\\\nCredits: kolbicz for the RemoteCall/CLSimulationManager GPS spoofer prototype, and ezzuldinSt's LSpoof for picker/route references.\\\\n\\\\nWarning: this can affect more than maps. Location-tied system behavior, including time zone and date/time handling, may behave unexpectedly. Only use this if you know what you're doing." = "Beta CoreLocation 模擬。需要已安裝並設定 Apple Maps；Maps 是驅動模擬的 RemoteCall 宿主行程。\\n\\n這是手動工具，不是可安裝套件。使用 Simulate Current Target 開始；使用 Restore Real Location 停止模擬並讓 CoreLocation 回到真實定位提供者。每次執行都會開啟活動日誌，並在請求返回後標記完成。\\n\\n並非所有 App 都會接受模擬位置。使用自身定位驗證或額外訊號的 App 可能會忽略它。\\n\\n鳴謝：kolbicz 的 RemoteCall/CLSimulationManager GPS spoofer 原型，以及 ezzuldinSt 的 LSpoof 選擇器/路線參考。\\n\\n警告：此功能影響的不只是地圖。與位置相關的系統行為，包括時區和日期/時間處理，可能出現異常。僅在你知道自己在做什麼時使用。";
"Beta: patches SpringBoard runtime methods in memory. Respring restores stock, but unsupported builds may glitch the app switcher or crash SpringBoard. Re-run after any respring." = "Beta：在記憶體中修補 SpringBoard 執行階段方法。respring 會恢復原生狀態，但不支援的系統可能導致 App 切換器異常或 SpringBoard 當機。每次 respring 後需要重新執行。";
"Beta: persistent CallServices system-file replacement. Disclosure sounds may be legally required where you live; you are responsible for your use and apply this at your own risk. Use Restore Original Sounds before removing Cyanide if you want Cyanide's backups written back." = "Beta：持久化取代 CallServices 系統檔案。你所在地可能依法要求保留提示音；使用風險由你自行承擔。若希望 Cyanide 寫回備份，請在移除 Cyanide 前使用 Restore Original Sounds。";
"Beta: RemoteCall-only physics can be reset by SpringBoard relayouts such as page swipes, rotations, folder transitions, or resprings. Use Restore Icon Layout if icons stay displaced." = "Beta：純 RemoteCall 物理效果可能被 SpringBoard 重新佈局重設，例如翻頁、旋轉、資料夾切換或 respring。如果圖示停留在錯誤位置，請使用 Restore Icon Layout。";
"Beta: requires Apple Maps installed and set up. Changes CoreLocation's active simulation state — may affect time zone, date/time, and other location-tied behavior. Some apps and services prohibit or detect simulated locations. Only use this if you know what you're doing." = "Beta：需要已安裝並設定 Apple Maps。會改變 CoreLocation 的活動模擬狀態，可能影響時區、日期/時間和其他依賴位置的行為。某些 App 和服務會禁止或偵測模擬位置。僅在你知道自己在做什麼時使用。";
"Beta: system asset page zeroing. Run by itself, then respring after hiding. To restore the home indicator, choose Restore Home Bar and respring." = "Beta：系統資源頁清零。請單獨執行，隱藏後立即 respring。要恢復 Home 指示條，請選擇 Restore Home Bar 並 respring。";
