"Changes the watchOS pairing range saved on this iPhone.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nMost people should use watchOS Range 99/23/10/6 in Settings, then apply the override. These are pairing protocol generations, not Apple Watch model numbers. 99 raises the watchOS pairing ceiling. 23 keeps the generation-23 setup protocol accepted. 10 and 6 leave the legacy chip and multi-watch floors at their normal values.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nApple Watch Ultra 3 cannot pair on iOS versions below 26 at this time.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nSystem-file warning: this modifies the local NanoRegistry compatibility-index MobileAsset and saves a .cyanide.bak backup beside the original file. Pairing-asset edits can fail, partially apply, require a respring or reboot to settle, or leave pairing state inconsistent. You apply or remove this override at your own risk.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nRespring or reboot after installing or removing the override before trying to pair." = "修改這台 iPhone 儲存的 watchOS 配對範圍。\\n\\n大多數人應在設定中使用 watchOS Range 99/23/10/6，然後套用覆寫。這些是配對協定世代，不是 Apple Watch 型號。99 提高手機端可接受的 watchOS 上限。23 保持接受第 23 代設定協定。10 和 6 讓舊晶片和多手錶下限保持正常值。\\n\\nApple Watch Ultra 3 目前無法在低於 iOS 26 的系統上配對。\\n\\n系統檔案警告：這會修改本機 NanoRegistry compatibility-index MobileAsset，並在原檔旁儲存 .cyanide.bak 備份。配對資源編輯可能失敗、部分套用、需要 respring 或重新啟動才能穩定，或留下不一致的配對狀態。套用或移除此覆寫需自擔風險。\\n\\n安裝或移除此覆寫後，請先 respring 或重新啟動再嘗試配對。";
"Changes the watchOS pairing range saved on this iPhone.\\\\n\\\\nMost people should use watchOS Range 99/23/10/6 in Settings, then apply the override. These are pairing protocol generations, not Apple Watch model numbers. 99 raises the watchOS pairing ceiling. 23 keeps the generation-23 setup protocol accepted. 10 and 6 leave the legacy chip and multi-watch floors at their normal values.\\\\n\\\\nApple Watch Ultra 3 cannot pair on iOS versions below 26 at this time.\\\\n\\\\nSystem-file warning: this modifies the local NanoRegistry compatibility-index MobileAsset and saves a .cyanide.bak backup beside the original file. Pairing-asset edits can fail, partially apply, require a respring or reboot to settle, or leave pairing state inconsistent. You apply or remove this override at your own risk.\\\\n\\\\nRespring or reboot after installing or removing the override before trying to pair." = "修改這台 iPhone 儲存的 watchOS 配對範圍。\\n\\n大多數人應在設定中使用 watchOS Range 99/23/10/6，然後套用覆寫。這些是配對協定世代，不是 Apple Watch 型號。99 提高手機端可接受的 watchOS 上限。23 保持接受第 23 代設定協定。10 和 6 讓舊晶片和多手錶下限保持正常值。\\n\\nApple Watch Ultra 3 目前無法在低於 iOS 26 的系統上配對。\\n\\n系統檔案警告：這會修改本機 NanoRegistry compatibility-index MobileAsset，並在原檔旁儲存 .cyanide.bak 備份。配對資源編輯可能失敗、部分套用、需要 respring 或重新啟動才能穩定，或留下不一致的配對狀態。套用或移除此覆寫需自擔風險。\\n\\n安裝或移除此覆寫後，請先 respring 或重新啟動再嘗試配對。";
