"Drives thermalmonitord with synthetic thermal pressure to underclock the CPU and GPU. Useful for cooling-sensitive workloads or extending runtime under load. Effects persist until reboot.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nNominal is the daily-use default. Light, Moderate, and Heavy intentionally underclock the CPU more, so lag and slower app launches mean it is working as intended. Those levels can be too slow for comfortable day-to-day use, especially on older devices.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nPick a level in the Settings tab." = "用模擬溫度壓力驅動 thermalmonitord，從而降低 CPU 和 GPU 頻率。適合對溫度敏感的負載或延長高負載續航。效果會持續到重新啟動。\\n\\nNominal 是日常使用預設值。Light、Moderate 和 Heavy 會有意進一步降低 CPU 頻率，因此卡頓和 App 啟動變慢代表功能按預期生效。尤其在舊裝置上，這些等級可能慢到不適合日常使用。\\n\\n請在設定標籤頁選擇等級。";
"Drives thermalmonitord with synthetic thermal pressure to underclock the CPU and GPU. Useful for cooling-sensitive workloads or extending runtime under load. Effects persist until reboot.\\\\n\\\\nNominal is the daily-use default. Light, Moderate, and Heavy intentionally underclock the CPU more, so lag and slower app launches mean it is working as intended. Those levels can be too slow for comfortable day-to-day use, especially on older devices.\\\\n\\\\nPick a level in the Settings tab." = "用模擬溫度壓力驅動 thermalmonitord，從而降低 CPU 和 GPU 頻率。適合對溫度敏感的負載或延長高負載續航。效果會持續到重新啟動。\\n\\nNominal 是日常使用預設值。Light、Moderate 和 Heavy 會有意進一步降低 CPU 頻率，因此卡頓和 App 啟動變慢代表功能按預期生效。尤其在舊裝置上，這些等級可能慢到不適合日常使用。\\n\\n請在設定標籤頁選擇等級。";
