"Powercuff now defaults to Nominal.\n\nLight, Moderate, and Heavy intentionally underclock the CPU. That means lag or slower app launches can happen, especially on older devices. The lag means Powercuff is working, but those levels may be too slow for comfortable day-to-day use.\n\nUse Nominal for daily use, then raise it only when you want stronger throttling." = "Powercuff 現在預設使用 Nominal。\n\nLight、Moderate 和 Heavy 會有意降低 CPU 頻率。這表示裝置可能卡頓或 App 啟動變慢，尤其是在舊裝置上。出現卡頓代表 Powercuff 正在生效，但這些等級可能慢到不適合日常使用。\n\n日常使用建議選擇 Nominal，只在需要更強降頻時再調高等級。";
