"RemoteCall-only core port of Julio Verne's Gravity. Run applies UIDynamicAnimator gravity, collision, bounce, friction, optional dock physics, and accelerometer steering to SpringBoard icon snapshots. It can restore the icon layout or fire a manual explosion pulse while the SpringBoard session is active.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nNot included in this core port: Activator/Home-button hooks, drag gestures, automatic shake effects, and preference-daemon notifications." = "Julio Verne Gravity 的核心 RemoteCall-only 移植。Run 會對 SpringBoard 圖示快照套用 UIDynamicAnimator 重力、碰撞、彈性、摩擦、可選 Dock 物理和加速度計轉向。它可以恢復圖示佈局，也可以觸發手動爆炸脈衝。";
"RemoteCall-only core port of Julio Verne's Gravity. Run applies UIDynamicAnimator gravity, collision, bounce, friction, optional dock physics, and accelerometer steering to SpringBoard icon snapshots. It can restore the icon layout or fire a manual explosion pulse while the SpringBoard session is active.\\\\n\\\\nNot included in this core port: Activator/Home-button hooks, drag gestures, automatic shake effects, and preference-daemon notifications." = "Julio Verne Gravity 的核心 RemoteCall-only 移植。Run 會對 SpringBoard 圖示快照套用 UIDynamicAnimator 重力、碰撞、彈性、摩擦、可選 Dock 物理和加速度計轉向。它可以恢復圖示佈局，也可以觸發手動爆炸脈衝。";
"RemoteCall-only port of the usable FastLockX primitives recovered from the iOS 15 tweak by Artem Kasper.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nCredits: original FastLockX by Artem Kasper; Cyanide FastLockX Lite port by zeroxjf.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nIt can pulse SpringBoard's biometric retry path, ask the iOS 26 biometric coordinator to start a Mesa/Face ID unlock, and send the original Lock Screen unlock request as a fallback. Installing it through Apply Tweaks keeps those retry/unlock requests armed with SpringBoard timers so pickup-to-unlock can work after Cyanide closes. The pulse loop pauses again after unlock.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nUse Disable, Clean Up, or a respring to stop the timers." = "從 Artem Kasper 的 iOS 15 tweak 中恢復可用 FastLockX 原語，並做成 RemoteCall-only 移植。\\n\\n鳴謝：原始 FastLockX 作者 Artem Kasper；Cyanide FastLockX Lite 移植由 zeroxjf 完成。\\n\\n它可以觸發 SpringBoard 的生物辨識重試路徑，請求解鎖，並可選保持 Always On。Always On 依賴 SpringBoard 計時器，因此如果 Face ID 變得頻繁或不穩定，請停用或 respring。";
"RemoteCall-only port of the usable FastLockX primitives recovered from the iOS 15 tweak by Artem Kasper.\\\\n\\\\nCredits: original FastLockX by Artem Kasper; Cyanide FastLockX Lite port by zeroxjf.\\\\n\\\\nIt can pulse SpringBoard's biometric retry path, ask the iOS 26 biometric coordinator to start a Mesa/Face ID unlock, and send the original Lock Screen unlock request as a fallback. Installing it through Apply Tweaks keeps those retry/unlock requests armed with SpringBoard timers so pickup-to-unlock can work after Cyanide closes. The pulse loop pauses again after unlock.\\\\n\\\\nUse Disable, Clean Up, or a respring to stop the timers." = "從 Artem Kasper 的 iOS 15 tweak 中恢復可用 FastLockX 原語，並做成 RemoteCall-only 移植。\\n\\n鳴謝：原始 FastLockX 作者 Artem Kasper；Cyanide FastLockX Lite 移植由 zeroxjf 完成。\\n\\n它可以觸發 SpringBoard 的生物辨識重試路徑，請求解鎖，並可選保持 Always On。Always On 依賴 SpringBoard 計時器，因此如果 Face ID 變得頻繁或不穩定，請停用或 respring。";
