"Changes the watchOS pairing range saved on this iPhone.\n\nMost people should tap Use watchOS Range 99/23/10/6, then Apply Pairing Override. These are pairing protocol generations, not Apple Watch model numbers. 99 raises the watchOS pairing ceiling. 23 keeps the generation-23 setup protocol accepted. 10 and 6 leave the legacy chip and multi-watch floors at their normal values.\n\nApple Watch Ultra 3 cannot pair on iOS versions below 26 at this time.\n\nRespring or reboot after applying before you try to pair." = "修改這台 iPhone 儲存的 watchOS 配對範圍。\n\n大多數人應點選「使用 watchOS 範圍 99/23/10/6」，然後點選「套用配對覆寫」。這些是配對協定世代，不是 Apple Watch 型號數字。99 會提高 watchOS 配對上限；23 會保留第 23 代設定協定可被接受；10 和 6 會讓舊晶片與多手錶下限保持正常值。\n\nApple Watch Ultra 3 目前無法在低於 iOS 26 的系統上配對。\n\n套用後請先 Respring 或重新開機，再嘗試配對。";
"Legacy icon theme engine settings.\n\nPick a theme before running the icon theme engine.\n\nCompatibility: when Dynamic Stage Lite is enabled, live icon repair is paused to avoid SpringBoard resprings. The selected theme still applies once.\n\nCustom themes can be a folder of PNG files named by bundle ID, such as com.apple.mobilesafari.png, or a binary plist mapping bundle IDs to PNG data. Import copies the theme into Cyanide's Documents/Themes folder. Theme Format Guide includes examples and plist exports." = "舊版圖示主題引擎設定。\n\n執行圖示主題引擎前請先選擇主題。\n\n相容性：啟用 Dynamic Stage Lite 時，即時圖示修復會暫停，以避免 SpringBoard Respring。所選主題仍會套用一次。\n\n自訂主題可以是按 bundle ID 命名的 PNG 資料夾，例如 com.apple.mobilesafari.png；也可以是將 bundle ID 對應到 PNG 資料的二進位 plist。匯入會將主題複製到 Cyanide 的 Documents/Themes 資料夾。主題格式指南包含範例和 plist 匯出。";

