/* Metal Lock Light */
"Metal Lock Light" = "Metal 鎖定畫面光效";
"Sticker-style Metal light on Lock Screen" = "Sticker 風格的鎖定畫面 Metal 光效";
"Experimental PoC that inserts a CAMetalLayer into SpringBoard's Lock Screen window and renders one Sticker-inspired light frame.\n\nThis validates whether Metal rendering is usable for a future gravity-reactive Lock Screen light effect. No motion tracking is wired yet." = "實驗性 PoC：向 SpringBoard 鎖定畫面視窗插入 CAMetalLayer，並渲染一幀受 Sticker 啟發的光效。\n\n用於驗證 Metal 渲染是否適合之後實作隨重力變化的鎖定畫面光效。目前尚未接入動態追蹤。";
"Experimental PoC that inserts a CAMetalLayer into SpringBoard's Lock Screen window and renders a bundled test image with Sticker-inspired Metal effects.\n\nThis validates source-texture rendering and gravity-driven light movement before wiring the effect to the real Lock Screen wallpaper." = "實驗性 PoC：向 SpringBoard 鎖定畫面視窗插入 CAMetalLayer，並使用受 Sticker 啟發的 Metal 效果渲染內建測試圖。\n\n用於在接入真實鎖定畫面桌布前，驗證 source texture 渲染和重力驅動的光源移動。";
"Experimental: uses RemoteCall to create a CAMetalLayer inside SpringBoard. If the Lock Screen looks wrong, disable it or respring." = "實驗性功能：透過 RemoteCall 在 SpringBoard 內建立 CAMetalLayer。如果鎖定畫面顯示異常，請停用或 respring。";
